# Admin CSS

Full guide: [docs/development/admin-styling.md](../../docs/development/admin-styling.md)

- Entry: `app/assets/stylesheets/brawo_cms/admin.css` imports layered partials under `admin/`.
- Use `--brawo-*` variables from `admin/variables.css` before new hard-coded colors.
- Scope UI under `.brawo-admin`; do not override Bootstrap globally outside that wrapper.
- Field styles: `admin/fields/<type>.css` (one file per field type with custom CSS).
- Page builder styles: `admin/page_builder/` only.
- Shell chrome overrides (e.g. navbar toggle) go in `admin/shell/`, not field files.
- Section header comments for major blocks; avoid long per-selector commentary.
